TIP:  Find a good banjo player to accompany you.  The intro is the chords for the entire verse.  That final (G) on the intro and instrumental bridge is meant to be strummed on the lower three strings emphasizing the open 2nd and 3rd strings.

TIP:  You don't have to play the (D/A) but it's "more correct".  And if it doesn't transpose correctly play the root chord.
  
 
